# K03 S6 control (Codex K03-CALLABLE-PATH-20261007-25): Holder's field `fn: zz` names no method: with `Holder\zz()` the
# program is refused when Holder's references are resolved -- "unknown callable field", said at the root's statement --
# exactly as with the bare path (unit_s6_path_descriptor_refused).
Holder:
    fn: zz
end: Holder
fn: run () int
    int: v Holder\zz()
    return: v
end: run
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: run(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
